# Overview

A Data Dictionary is a document that describes the structure of a dataset. It explains the meaning, data type, and purpose of each column to ensure consistent understanding before analysis begins.

Creating a Data Dictionary is an essential step because it helps analysts understand the dataset before performing data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, or visualization.

